{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"erd-title","type":"text","text":"# 🗄️ StockFlow Database ERD Schema\nRelational Data Model & Integrity Constraints (**Prisma 7 / SQLite**)","x":-60,"y":-340,"width":840,"height":130,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"constraints-info","type":"text","text":"### 🛡️ Database Constraints & Business Invariants\n\n1. **Multi-Tenant User Isolation (A7)**:\n   * Setiap query inventaris & faktur wajib terikat `userId`.\n   * SKU bersifat unik per-user (`@@unique([userId, sku])`).\n\n2. **Money Precision & No Floats**:\n   * `unitPrice`, `subtotal`, `taxAmount`, `total` disimpan sebagai **Integer Minor Units** (Rupiah/Cents).\n\n3. **Referential Integrity & Delete Guard (I4)**:\n   * Relasi `InvoiceItem.productId` menggunakan `onDelete: Restrict`.\n   * Produk yang sudah tercatat pada faktur tidak dapat dihapus sembarangan.\n\n4. **Snapshot Immutability (V4)**:\n   * `productName` dan `unitPrice` di-copy ke `InvoiceItem` saat pembuatan faktur.\n\n5. **Invoice Status Enum (V8)**:\n   * `DRAFT`, `ISSUED`, `PAID`, `CANCELLED`.","x":840,"y":-340,"width":380,"height":460,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"entity-invoice","type":"text","text":"### 🧾 Invoice (Faktur Penjualan)\n| Field | Type | Attributes / Constraints |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `id` | String | **PK**, CUID / UUID |\n| `userId` | String | **FK** -> `User.id` (Indexed) |\n| `invoiceNumber`| String | **Unique** (`INV-YYYY-XXXX`) |\n| `customerName` | String | Required |\n| `issueDate` | DateTime | Tanggal penerbitan |\n| `dueDate` | DateTime | Batas jatuh tempo |\n| `status` | Enum | `DRAFT \\| ISSUED \\| PAID \\| CANCELLED` |\n| `notes` | String? | Nullable / Optional |\n| `taxRate` | Int | Persentase pajak (default 11%) |\n| `subtotal` | Int | Total sebelum pajak (cents) |\n| `taxAmount` | Int | Nilai pajak (cents) |\n| `total` | Int | Total akhir (cents) |\n| `createdAt` | DateTime | Default `now()` |\n| `updatedAt` | DateTime | Auto-updated |\n\n* **Relations**:\n  * `user`: `User` (N : 1)\n  * `items`: `InvoiceItem[]` (1 : N, Cascade Delete)","x":380,"y":10,"width":400,"height":490,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"entity-invoice-item","type":"text","text":"### 📋 InvoiceItem (Baris Item Faktur)\n| Field | Type | Attributes / Constraints |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `id` | String | **PK**, CUID / UUID |\n| `invoiceId` | String | **FK** -> `Invoice.id` (Indexed) |\n| `productId` | String | **FK** -> `Product.id` (Indexed, Restrict) |\n| `productName` | String | **Snapshot** nama saat faktur dibuat |\n| `unitPrice` | Int | **Snapshot** harga saat faktur dibuat |\n| `quantity` | Int | Kuantitas dipesan (`>= 1`) |\n| `lineTotal` | Int | `unitPrice * quantity` (cents) |\n| `createdAt` | DateTime | Default `now()` |\n| `updatedAt` | DateTime | Auto-updated |\n","x":380,"y":720,"width":400,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"entity-product","type":"text","text":"### 📦 Product (Inventaris / Katalog)\n| Field | Type | Attributes / Constraints |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `id` | String | **PK**, CUID / UUID |\n| `userId` | String | **FK** -> `User.id` (Indexed) |\n| `sku` | String | Unique per user (`@@unique([userId, sku])`) |\n| `name` | String | Required |\n| `description`| String? | Nullable / Optional |\n| `unitPrice` | Int | Minor units / Cents (`>= 0`) |\n| `quantityOnHand`| Int | Stok fisik (`>= 0`) |\n| `createdAt` | DateTime | Default `now()` |\n| `updatedAt` | DateTime | Auto-updated |\n","x":-400,"y":660,"width":480,"height":440,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"entity-user","type":"text","text":"### 👤 User (Pengguna / Workspace)\n| Field | Type | Attributes / Constraints |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `id` | String | **PK**, CUID / UUID |\n| `email` | String | **Unique**, Indexed |\n| `password` | String | Hashed (Argon2 / Bcrypt) |\n| `name` | String? | Nullable / Optional |\n| `createdAt` | DateTime | Default `now()` |\n| `updatedAt` | DateTime | Auto-updated |\n\n* **Relations**:\n  * `products`: `Product[]` (1 : N)\n  * `invoices`: `Invoice[]` (1 : N)","x":-350,"y":-85,"width":380,"height":340,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"edge-user-to-product","fromNode":"entity-user","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"entity-product","toSide":"top","label":"1 : N"},
		{"id":"edge-user-to-invoice","fromNode":"entity-user","fromSide":"right","toNode":"entity-invoice","toSide":"left","label":"1 : N"},
		{"id":"edge-invoice-to-items","fromNode":"entity-invoice","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"entity-invoice-item","toSide":"top","label":"1 : N"},
		{"id":"edge-product-to-items","fromNode":"entity-product","fromSide":"right","toNode":"entity-invoice-item","toSide":"left","label":"1 : N"}
	]
}